      "end_ms": 29070,
      "text": "它咱们的代谢很容易变慢，",
      "token_start": 142,
      "token_end_exclusive": 153
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 29130,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "text": "这个地方很容易掉。",
      "token_start": 153,
      "token_end_exclusive": 161
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 31340,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "所以啊朋友们人到中年，",
      "token_start": 161,
      "token_end_exclusive": 171
    },
    {
